      "source": "knowledge/about.md",
      "text": "# About Celal Kekeç\n\n## Personal Information\nCelal Kekeç is 27 years old and currently based in Kilis, Turkey.\n\nHe is known as a hardworking, disciplined and collaborative person.  \nDuring high school he was socially active and well-liked by his peers.\n\n---\n\n## Education Journey\nHe studied Computer Engineering at Middle East Technical University (METU), one of the most prestigious universities in Turkey.\n\nHe was admitted to METU by ranking within the top 2000 in the national university entrance exam.\n\nHis education provided a strong foundation in:\n- Algorithms\n- Data structures\n- Computer systems\n- Software engineering principles\n- Analytical thinking\n\n---\n\n## University Life\nDuring his university years he was not only focused on academics but also actively participated in communities.",
