      "text": "He joined:\n- C Code Community\n- Chess Community\n- Guitar Community\n\nThese experiences helped him improve:\n- Teamwork and communication\n- Strategic thinking\n- Creativity and discipline\n\n---\n\n## Personality\nCelal is a product-oriented frontend developer who enjoys building user-focused applications.\n\nHe is:\n- Detail-driven\n- Curious about new technologies\n- Passionate about clean and maintainable code\n- Focused on continuous self-improvement\n\nHe likes transforming complex problems into simple and intuitive user interfaces.\n\n---\n\n## Career Focus\nHis main focus is modern frontend development using:\n\n- React\n- Next.js   \n- TypeScript\n- JavaScript\n\nHe also has experience with:\n- REST API integration\n- End-to-end testing with Cypress\n- Performance optimization\n- Reusable component architecture",
